## 5. LinkedIn (done)

Page name: Otterly

Handle: /company/otterly

Description (company page):
```
Otterly is a calm ADHD task-starter for people who freeze
on ordinary tasks.

The core insight: task lists are the disease, not the cure.
Every other productivity app hands you a longer list.
Otterly's home screen shows one thing, never a list, never
a badge.

Features:
- Task Shrinker that breaks one hard task into 3-10 tiny
  physical steps
- The Room, a text-based body-double that sits quietly
  with you
- Braindump that turns a paragraph into a short list
- Energy-aware step sizing (low / medium / good)
- Voice capture for spoken tasks
- Soft streaks with seven quiet rings, no fire, no shame

Philippines-first, iOS launch. Free forever. Deep Shrink is
a one-time purchase or small monthly. Vouchers for anyone
who cannot pay.

Positioning: Start, Not Alone.
```

Already generated: otterly-profile-light.png, otterly-banner-linkedin-light.png (1584x396), otterly-cover-linkedin-company.png (4200x700)

