## House style reminders

From the product docs. Applies to every post:

- Short sentences. Active voice.
- No em dashes. No semicolons.
- No hashtags in prose (TikTok gets max 3 on last line only).
- No metaphors as a crutch.
- No "not just X but also Y" constructions.
- Specific over general.
- Warm, brief, no shame, no exclamation-mark hype.
- Never imply laziness, willpower, or "just try harder."
- Never manufacture guilt or urgency.
- Never gamify recovery.
- Positioning: "Start, Not Alone."
- Category: calm ADHD task starter (not productivity app).
